    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        286.1812438964844,
        418.81646728515625,
        302.56121826171875
      ],
      "text": "2.1.1 LC-aNAATs for detection of TB and resistance to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        492.2799987792969,
        294.651611328125,
        515.6900024414062,
        306.35162353515625
      ],
      "text": "NEW",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        302.9812316894531,
        136.97410583496094,
        319.3612060546875
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        329.61212158203125,
        527.3316040039062,
        342.75714111328125
      ],
      "text": "Rapid detection of TB and rifampicin resistance is a critical global priority. Over a decade ago, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        345.11212158203125,
        526.9666137695312,
        358.25714111328125
      ],
      "text": "first recommendation on molecular testing for the diagnosis of TB and detection of resistance",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        360.61212158203125,
        526.9656372070312,
        373.75714111328125
      ],
      "text": "significantly transformed the TB diagnostic landscape. These technologies have proven highly",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.11212158203125,
        526.9810180664062,
        389.25714111328125
      ],
      "text": "accurate compared with smear microscopy, and they can detect rifampicin resistance rapidly.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.61212158203125,
        526.9109497070312,
        404.75714111328125
      ],
      "text": "They do not require highly skilled individuals or designated molecular laboratory infrastructure",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.976675033569336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        407.11212158203125,
        526.9645385742188,
        420.25714111328125
      ],
      "text": "for testing. In addition, they are largely automated after sample loading, up to the final report",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.61212158203125,
        526.9921264648438,
        435.75714111328125
      ],
      "text": "generation. These features make this class of low-complexity automated tests appealing for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.11212158203125,
        307.3551025390625,
        451.25714111328125
      ],
      "text": "use in low- and middle-income countries (LMIC).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.1161193847656,
        526.9699096679688,
        475.2611389160156
      ],
      "text": "Uptake of these technologies has been slowed by barriers related to costs, the supply chain,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.6161193847656,
        527.2417602539062,
        490.7611389160156
      ],
      "text": "equipment maintenance and technical support. The lack of a healthy competitive environment",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.974069595336914,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.1161193847656,
        526.966796875,
        506.2611389160156
      ],
      "text": "has also been a contributory factor. The WHO Prequalification (PQ) programme for TB in vitro",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        508.6160888671875,
        526.9921875,
        521.7611083984375
      ],
      "text": "diagnostics (IVDs) has opened a pathway to allow more products to come to market and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        524.1160888671875,
        524.4069213867188,
        537.2611083984375
      ],
      "text": "ensure quality. The current guidelines facilitated this process with the introduction of class-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.6160888671875,
        526.959228515625,
        552.7611083984375
      ],
      "text": "based recommendations for low-complexity NAATs. WHO PQ assessment progress for all",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        555.0966796875,
        365.7779541015625,
        568.2611083984375
      ],
      "text": "4 low-complexity NAATs is reported on the WHO PQ website.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
